# Per-host .env profiles (e.g. .env.mac used by scripts/jarvis-profile). These
# hold REAL tokens and the shared MQTT credential. The existing `.env.local` /
# `.env.*.local` patterns miss `.env.mac`, leaving it untracked-but-not-ignored
# — one `git add .` from publishing secrets to a public repo.
.env.*
!.env.example
